bottled-searxng
===============

This repository packages SearXNG for Cloud in a Bottle / OpenHost.

SearXNG
-------
This image is built FROM the official SearXNG container image and distributes
SearXNG, a privacy-respecting metasearch engine.

  Upstream:    https://github.com/searxng/searxng
  License:     GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later (AGPL-3.0-or-later)
  Base image:  docker.io/searxng/searxng (see the FROM line in the Dockerfile)

Corresponding Source (AGPL-3.0 sections 6 and 13)
-------------------------------------------------
The complete, corresponding source of the SearXNG version distributed by this
image is the upstream repository:

  https://github.com/searxng/searxng

SearXNG's source is not modified by this package; configuration is applied at
runtime via the container entrypoint and settings.yml. Note: the Dockerfile
currently tracks the `searxng/searxng:latest` base image; pinning it to a
specific tag or digest is recommended so the exact corresponding source of a
given build is identifiable.

Third-party components
----------------------
The image also downloads and bundles the Caddy web server, used as a
Host-header rewriting / startup-bridging sidecar:

  https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy   (Apache License 2.0)

